                       g0-evaluations.json[ordinal]; else genGG/KK.pack.json.gz {schema jope.s1-invocation/v1,
                       attempt_id "genGG-KK", record}
  adapt_evaluation     jope.s1-evaluation/v1 {status, fold_protocol jope.s1-two-fold/v1, program{dsl,
                       program_sha256}, context_sha256, inner_cv_folds 2, inner_cv[2]{kind, index, metrics.rmse,
                       baseline_metrics.rmse, wall_us, score_rows, train_rows}}; finish status completed|failed|
                       timeout|unknown -> completed | failed:unclassified | timeout@90000ms | missing (never labelled)
"""
